.TH "RAPTOR-SPF" 1 "2026-10" "RAPTOR Studio" "RAPTOR Studio Manual"
.SH NAME
raptor\-spf \- List the elements whose failure alone takes the system down.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBraptor spf\fR [\-h] [\-o FILE] [\-f {text,json}] [\-\-criticality] MODEL
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the elements whose failure alone takes the system down.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Options
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fIFILE\fR
write the Raptor 7\-format text file to FILE
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR \fI{text|json}\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-criticality\fR
add the criticality column to the file (a Raptor 7 developer option)
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBraptor\fR(1)
